        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": "Title:Transcriptome analysis of LPS-stimulated peritoneal macrophages from UBE2M knockout mice\n\nDescription:This dataset contains RNA-sequencing data from a study investigating the role of UBE2M in macrophage inflammatory responses. The experiment compared transcriptional profiles between wild-type and UBE2M knockout peritoneal macrophages (PMs) following LPS stimulation.\n\nExperimental Design:- Mouse Model: UBE2M conditional knockout using LysM-Cre system- Cell Type: Peritoneal macrophages (PMs)- Treatment: Lipopolysaccharide (LPS)- Groups:\u00a0\u00a0 * Wild-type + LPS (WL1, WL2, WL3; three biological replicates)\u00a0 * UBE2M knockout + LPS (KL1, KL2, KL3; three biological replicates)\n\nData Description:The dataset includes:1. Gene expression matrix containing counts for all detected genes\n\nData Format:- Expression matrix: .csv- Gene IDs: Ensembl gene identifiers with corresponding gene symbols- Expression values: [Counts]\n\n\u00a0",
            "descriptionType": "Abstract"
          }
